{
  "slug": "resume-career-toolkit",
  "name": "Resume Career Toolkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A comprehensive career toolkit with 20 skills covering the full job search lifecycle, from resume writing and ATS optimization to interview preparation, salary negotiation, and offer evaluation. Includes specialized guides for tech roles, executive positions, academic CVs, career pivots, and creative portfolios.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **20 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (20): `academic-cv-guide` (Format a curriculum vitae for academic positions including publications, grants, teaching, and service), `ats-resume-checker` (Diagnose and fix ATS parsing failures in resumes), `bullet-point-rewriter` (Rewrite flat resume bullets into achievement statements with measurable outcomes), `career-pivot-guide` (Help career changers translate their experience into the language of a new industry), `case-study-builder` (Turn resume achievements into detailed portfolio case studies for PM, design, engineering, or marketing roles), `cover-letter-writer` (Draft a cover letter that connects a resume to a specific job posting with genuine, specific hooks), `creative-resume-guide` (Balance visual design quality with ATS compatibility for creative and design roles), `executive-resume` (Write resumes for VP, C-suite, and board-level positions that emphasize strategic leadership and organizational impact), and 12 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install resume-career-toolkit@claude-community` from `jirawatp/resume-career-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
